    "Id": "chassisdef_blackknight_BL-P-KNT_partisan",
    "Name": "Black Knight",
    "Details": "This variant is based on Ian McKinnon's Black Knight. The only difference is the Hatchet being replaced by an Autocannon/5 and SRM-2.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Upper</color>",
